Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:23.19,Kick,,0,0,0,,BLINKIT · EXPLAINED
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:23.19,Title,,0,0,0,,HOW BLINKIT\NTURNED A PROFIT
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:23.19,Foot,,0,0,0,,Source: Eternal results via Indian Startup News\NFull video on the channel
Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.15,0:00:02.40,Big,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1640)\fad(120,150)}−₹156 CR → +₹184 CR
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:03.00,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,60)}You probably ordered from Blinkit this week.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.00,0:00:06.60,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,60)}A year ago, it was losing ₹156 crore a quarter.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.60,0:00:08.40,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,60)}Now it makes ₹184 crore.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.40,0:00:09.18,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,60)}Here is why.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.18,0:00:13.12,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,60)}That's less than one rupee of profit for every hundred rupees of orders.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.12,0:00:15.96,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,60)}Thin, but it has improved for six quarters in a row.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.41,0:00:19.99,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,60)}And in its oldest cities, the margin is already above five percent.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.99,0:00:21.22,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,60)}That's the real signal:
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.22,0:00:23.19,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,60)}once a store matures, it makes money.
